Add E2 and E3 analyses

E2: retention per tier and cell; D=0 calibration slope on the logit of the
per-type agreement rate and AUROC with world-bootstrap intervals; D=1
survival vs checker pass rate; the path-3 verdict. E3: static
ContractValid by horizon, five-part costs, serving cost relative to a full
re-read, T3/T4 checks and the preregistered H_U decision rule.

